<title>USA: PG Energy completes self-tender for preferred.</title>
<headline>PG Energy completes self-tender for preferred.</headline>
<dateline>WILKES BARRE, Pa. 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>PG Energy Inc said Tuesday it expects to buy 29,000 shares of its 4.1 percent cumulative preferred stock in a self-tender offer that expired Friday.</p>
<p>PG Energy, a unit of Pennsylvania Enterprises Inc, said it will pay $70 per cumulative preferred share it buys back. The count is based on a preliminary figures taken at the time of expiration, it said.</p>
</text>
